:INFO
Art. 41c
1 To ensure compliance with the rules of scientific integrity and good scientific practice, the SNSF, Innosuisse and the research institutes of the ETH Domain may, in their proceedings concerning breaches of these rules, make use of the services of the Swiss Competence Centre for Scientific Integrity in accordance with Article 5 paragraphs 2–5 of the Higher Education Council Ordinance of 20 November 2024 on Quality Assurance in relation to Scientific Integrity (O-QASI), in its version of 20 November 2024.
2 They may report breaches of scientific integrity and cases of scientific misconduct in accordance with Article 3 of the O-QASI.
|

